# Script catalog

5 scripts. Run with `strata run <id> -- <args>`; find with `strata search '<need> kind:script'`.

| id | summary | side effect | runtime | usage |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| check-deploy-config | (deprecated → check-migrations) Validate Helm values files for required resources and image tags. | read-only | go | `check-deploy-config [--chart DIR] [--format text\|json]` |
| check-migrations | Verify every alembic migration has a downgrade and no blocking index builds. | read-only | go | `check-migrations [--dir DIR] [--format text\|json]` |
| find-leaked-fixtures | Detect pytest fixtures that acquire resources without teardown. | read-only | python | `find-leaked-fixtures [--path DIR] [--format text\|json]` |
| normalize-csv | Normalize a CSV file to UTF-8, LF endings, and trimmed fields. | read-only | go | `normalize-csv FILE [--format text\|json]` |
| render-release-notes | Render release notes from conventional commits since the last tag. | writes-local | go | `render-release-notes [--since TAG] [--out FILE]` |
